# HERE Technologies

> HERE Technologies is the world's #1 location platform, powering real-world AI and enterprise applications with global map data, advanced routing APIs, and location intelligence.

HERE provides a live, unified map platform used by automakers, fleets, and developers to build automated driving, fleet routing, and agentic AI solutions on trusted, global location data.

## Platform

- [Platform overview](https://www.here.com/platform): HERE's integrated location data platform for building and scaling location-based services, solutions, and applications.

### Maps & data

- [Map Data](https://www.here.com/platform/map-data): Industry-leading map data as a canvas, layerable with data from other sources; 1,000+ attributes across 200 countries.
- [Dynamic Map Content](https://www.here.com/platform/dynamic-map-content): Real-time content APIs — hazard alerts, variable speed signs, and other dynamic datasets from vehicle sensors and infrastructure.
- [Maps for ADAS & HAD](https://www.here.com/platform/adas-had): Location technology, maps, and data for assisted and automated driving systems.

### Location services

- [HERE Routing](https://www.here.com/platform/routing): Routing portfolio for connected journeys across fleets, passengers, and businesses, for various transport modes.
- [HERE Geocoding & Search](https://www.here.com/platform/geocoding): Precise conversion and discovery of geocoordinates, POIs, and addresses.
- [HERE Map Rendering](https://www.here.com/platform/map-rendering): Daily-updated, accurate geospatial data rendering for business needs.
- [HERE Positioning](https://www.here.com/platform/positioning): High-precision location awareness for apps and devices, including challenging indoor/outdoor environments.
- [HERE Tour Planning](https://www.here.com/platform/tour-planning): Many-to-many route planning and customizable en-route optimization to improve fleet utilization.
- [Fleet Optimization package](https://www.here.com/platform/fleet-optimization): Bundled REST API suite (Routing, Geocoding, Tour Planning, Map Rendering) for cost-effective fleet management and route planning.

### Tools & SDKs

- [HERE SDK](https://www.here.com/platform/here-sdk): Development kit for integrating location features into apps online or offline, with pre-built UIs.
- [HERE Live Sense SDK](https://www.here.com/platform/live-sense-sdk): AI-powered SDK that turns camera-enabled devices into hazard awareness sensors for drivers.
- [HERE Anonymizer](https://www.here.com/platform/anonymizer): Configurable real-time anonymization tools for using location data at scale while preserving privacy.

